# Product Completion Queue — Infinite Mode

Read `docs/PRODUCT_COMPLETION_QUEUE.md` and `docs/QUEUE_STATE.md` before every work item.

## Goal

**Product completion only.** Not version · release · sprint · epic · mission completion.

## Never stop

Consume Areas 1–20 → repeat Area 1. Slice empty → generate from Vision (`docs/EVOLUTION_QUEUES.md`).

## Vision (immutable)

**AI Strategy Project Manager** — AI leads, user approves. `docs/PRODUCT_VISION_V3.md`

## Quality bar (each item)

Feature + UX + Animation + Loading + Error + Empty + Retry + Offline + A11y + Responsive + SEO + Perf + Analytics + Admin + Docs + Regression + Deploy + Production smoke.

## Auto cycle

Implement → QA → Build → Commit → Push → Production → Smoke → Docs → QUEUE_STATE → **next item**

No approval · No questions · No deploy/commit asks.

## Stop (5)

Build fail · Prod outage · DB/LLM/Billing/Auth cost · Security · Vision change

## Forbidden output

완료 · 끝 · Queue empty · 다음 작업 없음 · 승인 · 배포할까요 · Release/Epic/Sprint 완료 보고

## Report

08:00 KST Daily Product Evolution Report only
